## 8426-8440 · 2026-10-04 · Investigated Paseo system prompt feature
Paseo's `systemPrompt` is a per-agent config field in `AgentSessionConfig`, set via UI (Settings → Host → Orchestration → System Prompt) or API. Each provider maps it differently: Claude → direct, PI → temp extension file, Opencode v2 → session config, Opencode v1 → NOT consumed. A `daemonAppendSystemPrompt` combines with the per-agent prompt for global + per-agent layering. Critical for our setup: opencode v1 does not consume this field.

