The nuance: a `needs-maintainer` label parks the issue so the bot ignores new comments (waiting on the maintainer). An explicit `@paseo-bot &lt;reason&gt;` ping overrides that gate and forces a re-review regardless. Saved as memory (ID 1331, CONFIG_VALUES). Practical rule: normal comments on a `needs-maintainer` issue are ignored; `@paseo-bot &lt;reason&gt;` is the only nudge that pokes it back into diagnosis.

