And on the historian: MC's `magic-context.jsonc` shows historian/dreamer each have their own per-harness model, fully decoupled from the main agent. My "MC runs in-harness, can't separate" contrast was wrong — MC is exactly as decoupled as TencentDB's memory-group LLM. The only difference is MC decouples within the plugin config vs TencentDB's separate service env.

